"site.lc.lcOpensDiscordAgain4": "Lc öffnet <a onclick=\"pop('https://discordapp.com/invite/CbMkY77');\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"> Discord</a> wieder. Klicke <a onclick=\"pop('https://discordapp.com/invite/CbMkY77');\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"> hier</a>, um beizutreten",
